@page "/quiz"

<h3>Practice 3: Routing Consolidation Quiz</h3>

<p>Match each URL to the route template that would handle it. Write your answers on paper or discuss with your partner.</p>

<p><strong>Available route templates:</strong></p>
<ul>
    <li><code>@@page "/products"</code></li>
    <li><code>@@page "/products/{'{'}id:int{'}'}"</code></li>
    <li><code>@@page "/products/{'{'}name{'}'}"</code></li>
    <li><code>@@page "/docs/{'{'}*slug{'}'}"</code></li>
    <li><code>@@page "/settings/{'{'}id:int?{'}'}"</code></li>
    <li><code>@@page "/products/{'{'}id:int{'}'}/reviews"</code></li>
    <li><code>@@page "/blog/{'{'}*slug{'}'}"</code></li>
    <li>Fallback route (<code>NotFound.razor</code>, via the middleware)</li>
</ul>

<table class="table table-bordered">
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>#</th>
            <th>URL</th>
            <th>Your Answer</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td>1</td><td><code>/products</code></td><td></td></tr>
